{"agent_id":"anon-b19d58ac","agent_seq":11,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T00:28:35.639030264Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"e344a032-c88e-48fd-a660-f46361a0227b","comment_uuid":"828b6a5a-686b-4298-b3b1-e6f72d89df4d","author":"anon-b19d58ac","content":"Failing tests at crates/psptool-ops/tests/divergence_headerfile_list_values.rs: divergence_size_packed_normalises_zero_rom_size (size_packed 0x0 vs 0x8000), divergence_json_sizes_packed_normalises_zero_rom_size (packed 0 vs 32768) and divergence_corpus_sizes_packed_matches_reference (live PSPTOOL_REFERENCE, 147 HeaderFiles). #[ignore]d with this issue; control_size_packed_nonzero_rom_size passes.","created_at":"2026-10-20T00:28:35.639022499Z","kind":"observation"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-b19d58ac","agent_seq":12,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T00:28:42.970792275Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"a249be78-533d-4cb8-b9e7-69f2f9dd67f6","comment_uuid":"56d9becb-aab8-4961-9b13-e8eecc2393bf","author":"anon-b19d58ac","content":"Failing tests at crates/psptool-ops/tests/divergence_headerfile_list_values.rs: divergence_sparse_md5_hashes_headerfile_body (synthetic signed 0x1 HeaderFile: ours 7B6A = md5(whole entry), expected BF12 = md5(body[0x100:0x7f00])) and divergence_corpus_headerfile_md5_matches_reference (live PSPTOOL_REFERENCE, 4147 HeaderFiles). #[ignore]d with this issue.","created_at":"2026-10-20T00:28:42.970786745Z","kind":"observation"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-b19d58ac","agent_seq":13,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T00:28:54.757940738Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"66f52b44-3710-40c1-a7d8-ec78c4c0b185","comment_uuid":"be67b921-c8a7-4ad6-93a7-66f8948081b2","author":"anon-b19d58ac","content":"Not a future feature: the pinned oracle (PSPTool 241629b) ALREADY renders the full PSP ID — fet.py:117-123 (combo) and directory.py:89-95 (tertiary) build 'Zen 3 (PSP ID 0xbc0c0140)', and psptool.py:84 prints it; unknown ids render 'unknown (PSP ID 0x...)'. Ours renders 'Zen3' (psptool-ops list.rs zen_label). Failing pin: crates/psptool-ops/tests/divergence_generation_threading.rs::divergence_generation_label_includes_psp_id (#[ignore] tracking #57). Generation ATTRIBUTION divergences are separate: #116 (L2 inheritance), #117 (multi-combo accumulation).","created_at":"2026-10-20T00:28:54.757934717Z","kind":"observation"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-b19d58ac","agent_seq":14,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T00:39:05.013796842Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"84ff0006-28b2-4b33-a69e-b01eba5a138f","title":"Divergence: ls File Info of a HeaderFile adds 'signed' and 'sha256'/'sha384' tokens; upstream ls_files emits only outcome tags (psptool.py:113-140)","description":"Upstream (PSPTool 241629b, /tmp/psptool-ref/psptool/psptool.py:113-140) builds the TEXT ls File Info from outcome tags only: 'compressed'; for a signed file one of verified(..) / veri-failed(..) / key_missing(..) / invalid_sig(..); 'legacy_header'; 'encrypted'; for a HeaderFile with a checksum bit sha256_ok / sha256_inconsistent / sha384_ok / sha384_inconsistent; inline_keys(..). There is no bare 'signed' token and no bare 'sha256'/'sha384' token in ls_files (ls_files_dict's JSON info, psptool.py:232-244, has signed(..) and no sha tag).\n\nTarget: psptool-ops/src/list.rs info_list (list.rs:571-619) pushes \"signed\" before the signature tag (:589) and \"sha256\"/\"sha384\" before the checksum tag (:596, :602); .design/psptool-ops/list.md REQ-7 lists `signed`/`sha256`/`sha384` as tokens, but upstream's text listing has none of them.\n\nRepro: psptool AORUS_X570_X57AOXT2.FCd -E -> PSP_FW_TRUSTED_OS~0x2 @0x801200 File Info 'signed, verified(24C6), sha256, sha256_ok'; upstream 'verified(24C6), sha256_ok'. SMU_OFFCHIP_FW~0x8 @0x815600 'compressed, signed, veri-failed(96A0), sha256, sha256_ok' vs 'compressed, veri-failed(96A0), sha256_ok'.\n\nImpact (corpus): 4024 HeaderFile rows (every signed 0x1/0x2/0x8/0x24/0x28/0x39 … on every image incl. EPYC Milan H12SSW9.719 and Zen 2/3). With the two extra tokens removed, every HeaderFile row's File Info equals upstream's. Distinct from #114 (MISSING tokens on non-HeaderFile rows).\n\nFailing tests: crates/psptool-ops/tests/divergence_list_text_headerfile_cells.rs::divergence_file_info_has_only_upstream_outcome_tokens (synthetic: ours 'signed, key_missing(0000), sha256, sha256_ok', expected 'key_missing(0000), sha256_ok') and ::divergence_corpus_headerfile_file_info_matches_reference (live reference ls -v table, 4024 rows). Control control_file_info_outcome_tags_present passes.","priority":"low","created_by":"anon-b19d58ac"}}
